ty by $(0.6)^{3x-2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}}{(0.6)^{3x-2}} & <0 \\\\ (0.6)^{3x-2}\\cdot \\frac{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}}{(0.6)^{3x-2}} & <(0.6)^{3x-2}\\cdot 0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-4)^{3} & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve the inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}} & <\\sqrt[3]{0} \\\\ {x}^{2}-4 & <0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & <4 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & <\\sqrt{4} \\\\ |x| & <2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality is $-2<x<2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-115410/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f15241dd-898f-5f1c-9c1c-469a4af1fb80"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115410"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer/id #uuid "cd362e21-5cdd-541a-a773-a0032f6122ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "43ff7341-8644-51ac-afe1-ef0830dc3ff3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278219/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer-field/choices ["q-278219/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-2/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer/id #uuid "d7258ae2-184d-53bb-9f3a-43d391713394" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\ge" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "c4eadecf-dab9-5909-aa1a-f51ff976603c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278219/field-2/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer-field/choices ["q-278219/field-2/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-3/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "9a65eca1-5a10-5115-8d48-b3735395891f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8ebb9c8-6590-5761-870b-c483fe403c17" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278219/field-3/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-278219/field-3/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278219" :question/id #uuid "2be0e649-7ba0-5a50-84d9-4b69508aa9f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-278219" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $(49-{x}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}\\le 0.$\n\n$x\\le ${{field-1}}\n$\\,\\text{or}\\,x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "When we have an inequality involving an exponential function with a positive base, we're allowed to multiply or divide both sides by the exponential function.\n\nDividing both sides of the given inequality by ${6}^{3x-2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(49-{x}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2} & \\le 0 \\\\ \\frac{(49-{x}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}}{{6}^{3x-2}} & \\le \\frac{0}{{6}^{3x-2}} \\\\ (49-{x}^{2})^{3} & \\le 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve the inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{(49-{x}^{2})^{3}} & \\le \\sqrt[3]{0} \\\\ 49-{x}^{2} & \\le 0 \\\\ -{x}^{2} & \\le -49 \\\\ {x}^{2} & \\ge 49 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & \\ge \\sqrt{49} \\\\ |x| & \\ge 7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we had to flip the sign again of the inequality since we divided by a negative number ($-1$).\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality is $x\\le -7$ or $x\\ge 7.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-278219/field-1" "q-278219/field-2" "q-278219/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f15241dd-898f-5f1c-9c1c-469a4af1fb80"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278219"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "ae02397f-5aa4-5322-8744-7b16342006b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "839918da-bf53-5f3b-a165-15e48d53de70" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278239/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-278239/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer/id #uuid "44057b38-b9f3-583d-9557-dfa6f0ddb25d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value ">" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "adb7d7d6-cfd7-589d-8267-4fc720149477" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278239/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer-field/choices ["q-278239/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-3/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "ed980dda-d4cb-57c3-93d9-bce62f13ecaa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d39ae47-17dc-595e-91d5-d5742dfb7731" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278239/field-3/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-278239/field-3/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278239" :question/id #uuid "635c959c-0b6c-521a-a003-0a8f98853fab" :question/math-academy-id "q-278239" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-10\\cdot {5}^{2-7x}+3x\\cdot {5}^{2-7x}>-{5}^{2-7x}{x}^{2}.$\n\n$x<${{field-1}}\n$\\,\\text{or}\\,x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-10\\cdot {5}^{2-7x}+3x\\cdot {5}^{2-7x} & >-{5}^{2-7x}{x}^{2} \\\\ {5}^{2-7x}{x}^{2}-10\\cdot {5}^{2-7x}+3x\\cdot {5}^{2-7x} & >0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}+3x-10){5}^{2-7x} & >0 \\\\ (x+5)(x-2){5}^{2-7x} & >0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${5}^{2-7x}$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+5)(x-2){5}^{2-7x}}{{5}^{2-7x}} & >\\frac{0}{{5}^{2-7x}} \\\\ (x+5)(x-2) & >0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis represents an upwards parabola whose roots are at $x=-5$ and $x=2.$ The parabola is above the $x$-axis when $x<-5$ or $x>2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013930/assets/6b72efca34700ab06986460d4d190e0e83a4f0068c9effe20af622082a92b9a9.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality is $x<-5$ or $x>2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-278239/field-1" "q-278239/field-2" "q-278239/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278239"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer/id #uuid "1c9112c0-826c-5530-b408-4a44cca8af76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\ge" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230/field-1/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e" :answer/id #uuid "921f5927-9ea9-5c23-87bd-6773602d1371" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "<" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e474a135-4a8d-5917-97e1-361ddde125fb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278230/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer-field/choices ["q-278230/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" "q-278230/field-1/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230/field-2/59552bcb3d87e05f7fc53fa78ea3f164a56017eafe3545446ef16fd16689ded1" :answer/id #uuid "6e4151c8-cf8b-5346-9bdb-65030117bbbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{7}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "967efb26-8a8c-53da-babc-d97990daafa1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278230/field-2/59552bcb3d87e05f7fc53fa78ea3f164a56017eafe3545446ef16fd16689ded1" :answer-field/choices ["q-278230/field-2/59552bcb3d87e05f7fc53fa78ea3f164a56017eafe3545446ef16fd16689ded1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278230" :question/id #uuid "f6e4ba0f-cd7a-58d2-bdc5-b12f24161589" :question/math-academy-id "q-278230" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $5x\\cdot {3}^{x+1}+{3}^{x+1}\\ge -6\\cdot {3}^{x+1}.$\n\n$x$ \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x\\cdot {3}^{x+1}+{3}^{x+1} & \\ge -6\\cdot {3}^{x+1} \\\\ 5x\\cdot {3}^{x+1}+6\\cdot {3}^{x+1}+{3}^{x+1} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+6+1){3}^{x+1} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+7){3}^{x+1} & \\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${3}^{x+1}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(5x+7){3}^{x+1}}{{3}^{x+1}} & <\\frac{0}{{3}^{x+1}} \\\\ 5x+7 & \\ge 0 \\\\ 5x & \\ge 0-7 \\\\ x & \\ge -\\frac{7}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality above is $x\\ge -\\frac{7}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-278230/field-1" "q-278230/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278230"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection/12cf5bf844cf95b95e80f529266ac6af4ed60a8ea790e2b44db6283719be635c" :answer/id #uuid "bfb12ec1-c3b5-5401-892c-5b3277798689" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "all real numbers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection/81aa92c366ba0b839cdcddf5cc269fb01c63015e005dd31541802e5e6c435f68" :answer/id #uuid "3034693c-7fb3-5258-8954-9ad41a8e2b42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection/541f5c37a1ea188011012d49d98c19c90ac48d2e01b5254d4e6f9d334655d8a1" :answer/id #uuid "595ca0b2-a773-57c9-bd9a-3633c10c523c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection/05d24ba27c48bd272d6de4e9593b6cdbad70fd6352fad4d21a5e1f859d4a766b" :answer/id #uuid "8c979272-a42e-5228-9785-f5ad5eec9c45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>\\frac{6}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection/575c59b22393b2c2ae94cebca796d44c04cc04bd7a6f0c804338c22bb57532aa" :answer/id #uuid "6d3556b8-8616-512b-b97b-0a07701d46fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2<x<5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "be5bfae9-dccd-5239-9298-8bd3b14e5371" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115430/selection/12cf5bf844cf95b95e80f529266ac6af4ed60a8ea790e2b44db6283719be635c" :answer-field/choices ["q-115430/selection/12cf5bf844cf95b95e80f529266ac6af4ed60a8ea790e2b44db6283719be635c" "q-115430/selection/81aa92c366ba0b839cdcddf5cc269fb01c63015e005dd31541802e5e6c435f68" "q-115430/selection/541f5c37a1ea188011012d49d98c19c90ac48d2e01b5254d4e6f9d334655d8a1" "q-115430/selection/05d24ba27c48bd272d6de4e9593b6cdbad70fd6352fad4d21a5e1f859d4a766b" "q-115430/selection/575c59b22393b2c2ae94cebca796d44c04cc04bd7a6f0c804338c22bb57532aa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115430" :question/id #uuid "f16ad2b1-8aa8-5b8e-8f71-14422bf71237" :question/math-academy-id "q-115430" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $4\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}>-{6}^{3x-2}-{x}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\cdot {6}^{3x-2} & >-{6}^{3x-2}-{x}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2} \\\\ 4\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}+{6}^{3x-2}+{x}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2} & >0 \\\\ (4+1+{x}^{2}){6}^{3x-2} & >0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}+5){6}^{3x-2} & >0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${6}^{3x-2}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({x}^{2}+5){6}^{3x-2} & >0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+5 & >0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${x}^{2}+5>0$ for all values of $x,$ the solution is all real numbers." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-115430/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115430"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection/a5aebf57da01b39ff4b9f7842def2503f8b2d9138de46497e731803f80c1f17f" :answer/id #uuid "2941a21b-101a-53d0-85d8-cdb1a206a193" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge -2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection/74813e82dceba7527a506f1f2666fe2c4c2fe7c88a833170a466693e442516c5" :answer/id #uuid "eb4f80f8-ffe7-59f5-9e15-5dc18ac86477" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge 7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection/46256db3f7b93aaf4ab8f38eff9a5983f151fb21e8e1c0481e2b7084d61ee0be" :answer/id #uuid "dd0d5925-ae67-5cd7-a980-635fed6b60e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge \\frac{5}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection/978054b8ddf48bc635e6414792927435b1ed49c03f251021ce1612eba06c628b" :answer/id #uuid "4d04f1d3-5f95-5586-9004-29a38c36ce0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge \\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection/5f85cd1fd1dfd2a1824f1d8ad6829d25750d864d7dc839557ecbf7eeaf64d3d6" :answer/id #uuid "a8e3bc25-6b40-57f4-aeb7-042bb248b5b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge -\\frac{6}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "65963c00-0a90-56b3-be61-6ec87889c2d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115429/selection/5f85cd1fd1dfd2a1824f1d8ad6829d25750d864d7dc839557ecbf7eeaf64d3d6" :answer-field/choices ["q-115429/selection/a5aebf57da01b39ff4b9f7842def2503f8b2d9138de46497e731803f80c1f17f" "q-115429/selection/74813e82dceba7527a506f1f2666fe2c4c2fe7c88a833170a466693e442516c5" "q-115429/selection/46256db3f7b93aaf4ab8f38eff9a5983f151fb21e8e1c0481e2b7084d61ee0be" "q-115429/selection/978054b8ddf48bc635e6414792927435b1ed49c03f251021ce1612eba06c628b" "q-115429/selection/5f85cd1fd1dfd2a1824f1d8ad6829d25750d864d7dc839557ecbf7eeaf64d3d6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115429" :question/id #uuid "3754b800-5aa3-5f3a-a9b9-6e9a52514d6c" :question/math-academy-id "q-115429" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}\\ge -2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} & \\ge -2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} \\\\ 5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+4+2){7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+6){7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${7}^{2x+3}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+6 & \\ge 0 \\\\ 5x & \\ge -6 \\\\ x & \\ge -\\frac{6}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to the inequality above is $x\\ge -\\frac{6}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-115429/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115429"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "44cf8eba-22ad-568d-84ed-a2295fdf914d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "96352652-42ae-56a8-9893-0570b8a9ec28" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-276747/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-276747/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-2/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e" :answer/id #uuid "bcb6c826-cacf-579f-b2b7-33c7a1cdd65c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "<" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "19832d7c-d976-5a81-a2c3-3b8e83c588aa" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-276747/field-2/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e" :answer-field/choices ["q-276747/field-2/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-3/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "f48cca59-78f0-5760-925b-fdb9ff798be4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "e913e3cc-4569-517b-8c8c-7686e4fd7d81" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-276747/field-3/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-276747/field-3/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-276747" :question/id #uuid "eee0e3d3-41d0-5b08-ad62-df351dc1f2a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-276747" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-{2}^{2x-3}{x}^{2}+3x\\cdot {2}^{2x-3}>-4\\cdot {2}^{2x-3}.$\n\n{{field-1}} $<x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{2}^{2x-3}{x}^{2}+3x\\cdot {2}^{2x-3} & >-4\\cdot {2}^{2x-3} \\\\ (-{x}^{2}+3x+4){2}^{2x-3} & >0 \\\\ -({x}^{2}-3x-4){2}^{2x-3} & >0 \\\\ -(x+1)(x-4){2}^{2x-3} & >0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${2}^{2x-3}$ and get\n\n$$\n-(x+1)(x-4)>0.\n$$\n\nThis represents a downwards parabola whose roots are at $x=-1$ and $x=4.$ The parabola is above the $x$-axis when $-1<x<4.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013930/assets/df6c1c0ac26d9074f8c726b2265780fefad631561d7a729d2dfc7998ef043859.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution is $-1<x<4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-276747/field-1" "q-276747/field-2" "q-276747/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "479e5736-efe1-5e94-929f-3dcd6d13a733"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-276747"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115458/selection/175ef52c7cdb06c8c758131f3b3d42f8713702fec47ea0e26f67e14c38c8322f" :answer/id #uuid "5bbf0c20-a591-57ab-a8f4-